      "problem": "Find the cofactor of ${b}_{34}$ in \n$B=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}].$",
